Subject: [PATCH] Restore migrated settings with backup frame precedence

Map Molly shared-preference frames to their migrated SignalStore keys synchronously as the importer reads them. Later KeyValue frames then replace preference-only values or duplicate older values, matching the legacy exporter order.

Drain queued SignalStore writes before opening the restore transaction and remove the post-restore preference re-read that could replace newer KeyValue data. Add focused coverage for preference-only language/privacy/media settings and notification-privacy KeyValue precedence through importer storage writes.

